WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.700
Mark: Hey, guys!

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:02.880
Mark: Welcome to the Drunk Dunk Challenge.

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:04.940
Mark: Now for this one, we have drunk goggles right here.

00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:06.740
Mark: And we've set up a mini-obstacle course.

00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:08.660
Mark: So here's what's gonna happen.

00:00:08.660 --> 00:00:09.160
(Ryan burps)

00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:10.500
Mark: We are gonna put on these

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:11.640
Mark: And then we're gonna go over there.

00:00:11.640 --> 00:00:15.100
Mark: And we're gonna get spun five times by one of our "Teammates"

00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:17.380
Mark: Then we're gonna have to run this course

00:00:17.380 --> 00:00:19.600
Mark: Which I can't see very well because I have the goggles on.

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:21.820
Mark: And there will be a ball right here waiting for us

00:00:21.820 --> 00:00:23.820
Mark: That we have to pick up and then throw

00:00:23.820 --> 00:00:25.280
Mark: Into that target!

00:00:25.280 --> 00:00:26.400
Mark: But here's where it gets tricky.

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:29.260
Mark: If we miss, we have to go all the way back to the beginning

00:00:29.260 --> 00:00:32.900
Mark: And keep doing it over and over and over again until we get it in there

00:00:32.960 --> 00:00:33.520
Mark: Or

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:35.420
Mark: Three minutes?

00:00:35.620 --> 00:00:36.940
Mark: Three minutes is good?

00:00:36.940 --> 00:00:38.060
Matthias: Sure.
J-Fred: Three minutes!

00:00:38.060 --> 00:00:38.560
Mark: Sounds good?

00:00:38.560 --> 00:00:39.360
Mark: Ok.
Bryan: Sounds good to me.

00:00:39.360 --> 00:00:40.200
J-Fred: Sounds like a long time.

00:00:40.320 --> 00:00:41.040
Matthias: Ten spins?

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:42.720
Mark: Ten?

00:00:43.140 --> 00:00:44.860
Mark: Ten to start, five after.

00:00:44.860 --> 00:00:45.640
Matthias: Okay, ready?

00:00:45.640 --> 00:00:46.160
J-Fred: Sounds fair.

00:00:46.160 --> 00:00:47.020
J-Fred: Alright. 3--

00:00:47.020 --> 00:00:47.640
Matthias: Why are you--

00:00:47.640 --> 00:00:48.480
Matthias: Why are you doing that?
Mark: I'm ready to spin.

00:00:48.480 --> 00:00:50.160
Matthias: I know, but why are you crouching?

00:00:50.160 --> 00:00:51.080
Mark: I don't know.

00:00:51.080 --> 00:00:51.920
Matthias: Stand up.
Mark: I don't know, man!

00:00:51.920 --> 00:00:52.620
